WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.440 --> 00:00:07.240
And of course we played up in the nineteen . . . Well,

2
00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:16.200
you’d have to say . . . on one January 1936, the second Sugar Bowl game.

3
00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:25.540
Then we played Santa Clara [University] again in the 1937 Sugar Bowl game, so we lost both games.

4
00:00:25.540 --> 00:00:32.160
And a little irony of it, today, they go down a week or ten days in advance.

5
00:00:32.160 --> 00:00:39.380
Well, the day of the Sugar Bowl games we got on the train, back of the old . . . back of Tiger Stadium,

6
00:00:39.380 --> 00:00:46.240
had our pregame meal on the train and went straight to the stadium, played the ball game.

7
00:00:46.240 --> 00:00:48.820
I played sixty minutes in that one.

8
00:00:48.820 --> 00:00:56.720
And it raining so hard in the old Tulane stadium the ball would almost float.
